{"v":1,"book":"Exod","ch":9,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Then Jehovah said to Moses, Go to Pharaoh, and speak to him, Thus says Jehovah, the God of the Hebrews, Let My people go that they may serve Me.","tok":[{"t":"Then "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"said","s":["H0559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Moses","s":["H4872"],"a":[3]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Go","s":["H0935"],"a":[4]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"Pharaoh","s":["H6547"],"a":[6]},{"t":", and speak to him, Thus "},{"t":"says","s":["H0559"],"a":[10]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[11]},{"t":", the "},{"t":"God","s":["H0430"],"a":[12]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"Hebrews","s":["H5680"],"a":[13]},{"t":", Let My "},{"t":"people","s":["H5971"],"a":[16]},{"t":" "},{"t":"go","s":["H7971"],"a":[14]},{"t":" that they may "},{"t":"serve","s":["H5647"],"a":[17]},{"t":" Me."}]},{"n":2,"text":"For if you refuse to let them go and still retain them,","tok":[{"t":"For if you "},{"t":"refuse","s":["H3986"],"a":[2]},{"t":" to let them "},{"t":"go","s":["H7971"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and still retain them,"}]},{"n":3,"text":"Then the hand of Jehovah is going to be on your livestock which are in the field, on the horses, on the donkeys, on the camels, on the herds, and on the flocks with a very severe pestilence.","tok":[{"t":"Then the "},{"t":"hand","s":["H3027"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"is","s":["H1961"],"a":[3]},{"t":" going to be on your livestock which are in the "},{"t":"field","s":["H7704"],"a":[6]},{"t":", on the "},{"t":"horses","s":["H5483"],"a":[7]},{"t":", on the "},{"t":"donkeys","s":["H2543"],"a":[8]},{"t":", on the "},{"t":"camels","s":["H1581"],"a":[9]},{"t":", on the herds, and on the flocks with a "},{"t":"very","s":["H3966"],"a":[14]},{"t":" severe pestilence."}]},{"n":4,"text":"And Jehovah will make a distinction between the livestock of Israel and the livestock of Egypt, so that nothing will die of all that belongs to the children of Israel.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" will make a distinction between the livestock of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[4]},{"t":" and the "},{"t":"livestock","s":["H4735"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"],"a":[7]},{"t":", so that "},{"t":"nothing","s":["H1697"],"a":[13]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"die","s":["H4191"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of all that belongs to the children of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":5,"text":"And Jehovah set an appointed time, saying, Tomorrow Jehovah will do this thing in the land.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" set an "},{"t":"appointed","s":["H7760"],"a":[0]},{"t":" "},{"t":"time","s":["H4150"],"a":[2]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[3]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Tomorrow","s":["H4279"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[6]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"do","s":["H6213"],"a":[5]},{"t":" this "},{"t":"thing","s":["H1697"],"a":[7]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"And Jehovah did this thing on the next day; and all the livestock of Egypt died, but of the livestock of the children of Israel not one died.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"did","s":["H6213"],"a":[0]},{"t":" this "},{"t":"thing","s":["H1697"],"a":[3]},{"t":" on the next day; and all the livestock of "},{"t":"Egypt","s":["H4714"]},{"t":" "},{"t":"died","s":["H4191"],"a":[6]},{"t":", but of the "},{"t":"livestock","s":["H4735"],"a":[10]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"children","s":["H1121"],"a":[11]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Israel","s":["H3478"],"a":[12]},{"t":" not "},{"t":"one","s":["H0259"],"a":[15]},{"t":" "},{"t":"died","s":["H4191"],"a":[14]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":7,"text":"And Pharaoh sent to inquire, and indeed there was not so much as one of the livestock of the Israelites dead. But the heart of Pharaoh was stubborn, and he did not let the people go.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"Pharaoh","s":["H6547"],"